  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "An NES port of the game Food Fight, that was originally released on the the first Atari Flashback console in 2004. \r\n\r\nIn Food Fight, the player controls a young boy named Charley Chuck. The object of the game is to eat an ice cream cone located on the opposite side of an open playfield. The ice cream is slowly melting, and must be consumed before it melts completely. Standing between Charley and the ice cream are four chefs named Angelo, Jacques, Oscar, and Zorba. The chefs appear from holes in the floor of the level and will chase after Charley."
    }
  ],
